# The scanner's headline story: nesting, todo words from the
# book's own todo line, priority, COMMENT, tags with ARCHIVE,
# and a fifteen-star badge as a plain deep headline.

exec babble parse --dump b.org
cmp stdout want.json

-- b.org --
#+todo: PLANNED(p!) | LIVE(l!)

* PLANNED [#A] Top                :one:two:
** COMMENT Scratch
Some scratch prose.
** Kept                                :ARCHIVE:
*************** PLANNED badge line
* LIVE Done-ish
